=== Setsusha ===
The following shrines are enshrined within the shrine grounds: {{Sfn|Kijima Shrine (Heibonsha)|1979}}.
* Kogai Shrine
*: Deities enshrined: Hoshokugami, Silkworm God, Konohana Sakuyahime no Mikoto
*: Origin unknown {{Sfn|Kijimaza Amaterasu Mitama Shrine (Shikiuchi Shrine)|1979}}. The common name of Kijima Shrine, ``Silkworm Shrine,'' originates from this Seriyo Shrine.
* Akina Shrine
*: Enshrined deity: Mitsui Takayasu ({{ill|lt=Mitsui family|Q950465|qid=Q950465|1=Mitsui family}} distant ancestor) {{Sfn|Kijima Shrine (Heibonsha)|1979}}
* Inari Shrine
* Ryodo Shrine
